# Alembic revisions live here.
#
# This directory is intentionally empty in the Phase 1 tree: the local SQLite
# deployment creates its schema from the models at start-up
# (`Base.metadata.create_all`). To introduce versioned schema changes (or to move
# to PostgreSQL), generate the first revision from `backend/`:
#
#   uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "initial schema"
#   uv run alembic upgrade head
#
# `alembic/env.py` takes the database URL from the application settings, so the
# generated migration always targets the same database the app uses.
